        "Content": "Living/Dining Room\r\nDual-aspect room with solid wood flooring, recessed spotlighting, sash windows, polished granite fireplace with stove inset and TV point with alcove units to either side.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nFully tiled, recessed lighting, fitted with an extensive range of timber cabinetry, Neff gas hob with Neff extractor hood, French doors leading into the\r\n\r\nConservatory\r\nAdjoining the kitchen, opening onto the rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (First Return)\r\nRecessed Lighting, Bedside lighting, faux balcony overlooking the rear garden.\r\n\r\nBathroom (First Return)\r\nFitted with shower and Roca sanitary ware.\r\n\r\nLanding (Upper Floor)\r\nTwo Velux windows, warm oak handrail, glass balustrade\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Master)\r\nTwo sash windows, recessed spotlighting, extensive built-in clothes storage.\r\n\r\nEnsuite (Bedroom 2)\r\nRainfall shower and Roca sanitary ware.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nSash window, bedside lighting, headboard.\r\n\r\nEnsuite (Bedroom 3)\r\nBath with showerhead, sink with storage underneath.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (Garden Level)\r\nSash window, extensive fitted storage and shelving\r\n\r\nEnsuite (Bedroom 4)\r\nVanity unit with Roca sink and toilet. \r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nCobbled and tiled patio areas, decorative pebble detailing and external storage."
